WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.177 --> 00:00:02.144
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT WAS 2007.

00:00:02.145 --> 00:00:04.313
13 YEARS AGO.

00:00:04.314 --> 00:00:05.380
IT WAS GOOD ADVICE.

00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:07.182
WE SHOULD HAVE TAKEN IT.

00:00:07.183 --> 00:00:09.351
DOUGLAS McGREGOR, AUTHOR AND

00:00:09.352 --> 00:00:11.286
FREQUENT GUEST ON THE SHOW, HE

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:12.287
JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:12.288 --> 00:00:13.922
THANKS SO MUCH FOR COMING ON.

00:00:13.923 --> 00:00:14.589
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:15.324
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT WOULD BE THE

00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:17.192
REASON TO STAY IN IRAQ AT THIS

00:00:17.193 --> 00:00:17.492
POINT?

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:20.829
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T THINK OF ANY, TO BE

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.164
PERFECTLY BLUNT WITH YOU.

00:00:22.165 --> 00:00:23.598
NONE THAT ARE ANY GOOD.

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:26.201
THERE ARE PEOPLE WHO SYMPATHIZE

00:00:26.202 --> 00:00:27.836
WITH THOSE ARABS IN IRAQ WHO

00:00:27.837 --> 00:00:30.272
WOULD LIKE US TO STAY AS SOME

00:00:30.273 --> 00:00:32.774
SORT OF COUNTERWEIGHT TO IRAN.

00:00:32.775 --> 00:00:34.843
WE HAVE NO VITAL STRATEGIC

00:00:34.844 --> 00:00:36.345
INTEREST THAT COMPELS US TO BE

00:00:36.346 --> 00:00:36.845
THERE.

00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:38.180
THE PRESIDENT IS VERY LUCKY.

00:00:38.181 --> 00:00:40.315
THESE MISSILES, AS YOU POINTED

00:00:40.316 --> 00:00:42.084
OUT, WERE TARGETED IN ADVANCE

00:00:42.085 --> 00:00:44.119
AND WE WERE INFORMED IN ADVANCE

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.287
OF WHERE THEY WERE GOING TO

00:00:45.288 --> 00:00:47.389
LAND, SO WE WERE ABLE TO

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:50.192
EVACUATE SOLDIERS, SAILORS,

00:00:50.193 --> 00:00:53.895
AIRMEN AND MARINES HAVE HAVE NO

00:00:53.896 --> 00:00:54.296
CASUALTIES.

00:00:54.297 --> 00:00:55.564
THE PRESIDENT MADE THE RIGHT

00:00:55.565 --> 00:00:56.565
DECISION NOT TO RESPOND.

00:00:56.566 --> 00:00:58.667
HE NEEDS TO LIVE UP TO THE

00:00:58.668 --> 00:01:00.168
PROMISES HE MADE TO THE AMERICAN

00:01:00.169 --> 00:01:02.204
PEOPLE AND PULL US OUT OF SYRIA

00:01:02.205 --> 00:01:03.472
AND IRAQ.

00:01:03.473 --> 00:01:05.007
THAT WAR IS OVER.

00:01:05.008 --> 00:01:05.907
WE LOST IT.

00:01:05.908 --> 00:01:07.509
IRAN IS A WINNER AT THE MOMENT.

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:10.612
IT WON'T BE A WINNER FOR VERY

00:01:10.613 --> 00:01:10.912
LONG.

00:01:10.913 --> 00:01:13.081
IRAN HAS TO COMPETE WITH THE

00:01:13.082 --> 00:01:16.651
TURKS AND THE CITY OF ISLAMISTS

00:01:16.652 --> 00:01:18.387
FOR THE CITY OF IRAQ.

00:01:18.388 --> 00:01:19.788
OUR INTERESTS BEGIN ALONG A LINE

00:01:19.789 --> 00:01:21.757
THAT RUNS ACROSS THE TOP OF

00:01:21.758 --> 00:01:25.460
ISRAEL, JORDAN, SAUDI ARABIA,

00:01:25.461 --> 00:01:26.661
AROUND KUWAIT AND DOWN TO THE

00:01:26.662 --> 00:01:28.430
MIDDLE OF THE PERSIAN GULF.

00:01:28.431 --> 00:01:30.198
THAT'S WHERE OUR INTERESTS --

00:01:30.199 --> 00:01:31.366
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ON TO THE GULF.

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:31.767
OF COURSE.

00:01:31.768 --> 00:01:34.369
SO YOU'RE SAYING THAT IF WE WANT

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:36.872
TO IMPEDE THE GROWTH OF IRAN'S

00:01:36.873 --> 00:01:39.341
INFLUENCE IN THE REGION, HAND

00:01:39.342 --> 00:01:41.543
THEM IRAQ AND WISH THEM LUCK.

00:01:41.544 --> 00:01:44.212
IN THE SAME WAY THAT THE SOVIETS

00:01:44.213 --> 00:01:46.214
INVADE

00:01:46.215 --> 00:01:48.417
INVAING AFGHANISTAN

00:01:48.418 --> 00:01:50.185
PRECIPITATED THE END OF THE

00:01:50.186 --> 00:01:52.421
SOVIET EMPIRE.

00:01:52.422 --> 00:01:55.724
&gt;&gt; HE COVETS NORTHERN IRAQ.

00:01:55.725 --> 00:01:57.893
HE WOULD LIKE TO CONTROL ALL OF

00:01:57.894 --> 00:01:58.193
SYRIA.

00:01:58.194 --> 00:02:01.163
HE IS SENDING TROOPS INTO LIBYA

00:02:01.164 --> 00:02:01.696
AND TUNISIA.

00:02:01.697 --> 00:02:03.498
HE IS THE NEW PROBLEM FOR US.

00:02:03.499 --> 00:02:04.833
NOT IRAN.

00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:07.135
IRAN REALLY IS ON THE ROPES.

00:02:07.136 --> 00:02:08.336
ITS POPULATION IS SICK TO DEATH

00:02:08.337 --> 00:02:11.106
OF THE WARS BEING FOUGHT IN IRAQ

00:02:11.107 --> 00:02:14.743
AND SYRIA BY PROXY FORCES AND BY

00:02:14.744 --> 00:02:15.110
IRANIANS.

00:02:15.111 --> 00:02:16.611
THEY'VE TAKEN THOUSANDS OF

00:02:16.612 --> 00:02:17.045
CASUALTIES.

00:02:17.046 --> 00:02:19.614
MR. SOLEIMANI WAS POPULAR WITH

00:02:19.615 --> 00:02:21.516
MANY, BUT VERY UNPOPULAR WITH

00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:21.883
OTHERS.

00:02:21.884 --> 00:02:23.118
ESPECIALLY THE PEOPLE THAT LOST

00:02:23.119 --> 00:02:24.786
SONS FIGHTING IN THOSE

00:02:24.787 --> 00:02:25.153
COUNTRIES.

00:02:25.154 --> 00:02:26.555
LET'S GET OUT, LEAVE IT ALONE,

00:02:26.556 --> 00:02:28.256
LET THE PEOPLE THERE SORT IT

00:02:28.257 --> 00:02:28.523
OUT.

00:02:28.524 --> 00:02:29.858
AND THEY WILL.

00:02:29.859 --> 00:02:33.028
IRAN'S NOT GOING TO BE POPULAR

00:02:33.029 --> 00:02:33.862
FOR VERY LONG IN IRAQ.

00:02:33.863 --> 00:02:34.863
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IS THERE ANY HOPE

00:02:34.864 --> 00:02:35.764
THAT THAT HAPPENS?

00:02:35.765 --> 00:02:37.466
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE PRESIDENT CAN DO

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:37.732
IT.

00:02:37.733 --> 00:02:39.301
HE HAS A WONDERFUL OPPORTUNITY

00:02:39.302 --> 00:02:39.734
NOW.

00:02:39.735 --> 00:02:42.237
HE HAS A NEW POINT OF DEPARTURE.

00:02:42.238 --> 00:02:44.039
HE CAN TAKE THE CLEAN SHEET AND

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.707
PUT IT ON THE TABLE AND HE CAN

00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:49.978
SIT WITH THE IRANIANS AND SAY,

00:02:49.979 --> 00:02:51.012
LOOK, WHAT ARE YOUR INTERESTS,

00:02:51.013 --> 00:02:53.181
TELL US, WE'LL TELL YOU WHAT

00:02:53.182 --> 00:02:53.548
OURS ARE.

00:02:53.549 --> 00:02:55.417
HE CAN DRAW THAT LINE THAT I

00:02:55.418 --> 00:02:55.884
MENTIONED.

00:02:55.885 --> 00:02:57.686
THAT CAN BECOME THE TRUMP LINE.

00:02:57.687 --> 00:02:58.887
THAT'S HOW GREAT POWERS SORT

00:02:58.888 --> 00:02:59.955
THINGS OUT.

00:02:59.956 --> 00:03:01.123
BUT THERE'S NO SUPPORT IN THIS

00:03:01.124 --> 00:03:02.924
COUNTRY TO STAY IN IRAQ AND

00:03:02.925 --> 00:03:03.458
SYRIA.

00:03:03.459 --> 00:03:05.393
THERE IS NO SUPPORT IN THE

00:03:05.394 --> 00:03:06.094
UNITED STATES FOR A WAR OVER

00:03:06.095 --> 00:03:06.394
THERE.

00:03:06.395 --> 00:03:08.463
HE KNOWS THAT.

00:03:08.464 --> 00:03:10.599
SO WE HAVE TWO GROUPS OF PEOPLE

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.267
THAT KNOW SOMETHING.

00:03:12.268 --> 00:03:13.768
THE LEADERSHIP IN TEHRAN KNOWS

00:03:13.769 --> 00:03:15.904
IT DOESN'T WANT A WAR WITH US.

00:03:15.905 --> 00:03:17.939
WE KNOW WE DON'T WANT A WAR WITH

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:18.240
THEM.

00:03:18.241 --> 00:03:21.878
WHAT A WONDERFUL OPPORTUNITY TO

